@startuml
title sd — Consult retained CAN diagnostics (D1–D5)
actor Operator
participant "USB application" as App
participant BenchController as Control
participant TwaiPort as Port
participant "ESP-IDF TWAI" as SDK
App -> Control : service(now)
Control -> Port : poll()
Port -> SDK : read alerts and status
SDK --> Port : values or read errors
Port -> Port : retain snapshot with availability flags
Port --> Control : transmission failure
Control -> Port : stop()
Port -> SDK : stop / uninstall
note over Port
Cleanup does not overwrite the snapshot.
Next permitted start clears it.
end note
Operator -> App : connect USB, request status
App -> Port : diagnostics() const
Port --> App : retained snapshot
App --> Operator : bounded diagnostic lines or unavailable
@enduml
